eading the phone's script. Fixed: it now teaches the speed keys.The speed dial is 1x / 4x / 8x / 16x. 2x and 3x were barely worth the keystroke.The map. It no longer goes white when you explore a new district, and truck","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T13:40:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393486","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2649300-1845383656381223","game_id":"steam-2649300","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out and here's the story behind Plug","summary":"The Plug demo is live on Windows and Mac, right now.You get the first tiers: the full weed chain, the street, your firstcontacts, your first city. It's not a timer. It ends when you outgrowit, and your save carries over to the full game.I also made a video about where this project comes from, what the gameis really about, and what changes on PC. I'm a solo dev, Plug has beenlive on mobile for a while, and this is the PC version I always wantedto build.If you like what you play, the wishlist is t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T13:07:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381223","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2649300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2649300":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2649300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z"},"5258840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:57Z","last_succe